# Three 48x64 busts on one strip, drawn at 3x into the 144x192 portrait slot.
#
# Portraits are the entire visual budget of a visual novel, which is why this
# palette carries a skin ramp nobody else needs — a face built out of a generic
# warm ramp reads as a prop rather than a person.
#
# The three differ by hair value and by garment colour only. That is the honest
# limit at 48x64: past a point, more facial detail at this size just makes the
# face muddy, and the reader is looking at the text anyway.
name visualnovel-portraits
size 144 64
key o outline
key S skin-2
key L skin-1-shadow
key d lamp-0
key H hair-0
key h hair-1
key A night-1
key B lamp-0
key C room-2
pixels
